{"id":"vka4uv050s81uxiqofjb5a06u","title":"长链支化聚丙烯(LCBPP)制备技术及表征方法研究进展","originalTitle":null,"summary":"本文基于83篇最新文献，系统梳理了长链支化聚丙烯(LCBPP)的制备技术和表征方法，为学者突破其技术瓶颈提供参考。LCBPP通过在线性聚丙烯分子链上引入长支链结构，显著提升材料的熔体强度，适用于热成型、发泡、吹塑等加工方式。现有制备方法主要分为反应器法和后反应器法两大类，每种方法都有其优缺点。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3582600&do=blog&id=1560090"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T02:23:29.174Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T02:23:29.174Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["论文发表","Nature"],"score":35,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}